      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 79,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "普通八年，高祖遣兼領軍曹仲宗等攻渦陽，又以放爲明威將軍，帥師會之。",
      "reading": "普通八年攻渦陽。南史和陳慶之傳作大通元年，殿本考證並錄兩書紀年。",
      "note": "普通八年攻渦陽。南史和陳慶之傳作大通元年，殿本考證並錄兩書紀年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 33,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-33",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "魏大將費穆帥衆奄至，放軍營未立，麾下止有二百餘人。",
      "reading": "北魏費穆突至，韋放麾下二百餘人。",
      "note": "北魏費穆突至，韋放麾下二百餘人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 33,
      "end_codepoint": 58,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-58",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "放從弟洵驍果有勇力，一軍所仗，放令洵單騎擊刺，屢折魏軍，洵馬亦被傷不能進，放胄又三貫流矢。",
      "reading": "韋洵是韋放自家從弟，受命單騎出擊，戰馬受傷。中箭三矢為韋放頭盔。",
      "note": "韋洵是韋放自家從弟，受命單騎出擊，戰馬受傷。中箭三矢為韋放頭盔。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 58,
      "end_codepoint": 103,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
