      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "魏又遣常山王元昭、大將軍李獎、乞佛寶、費穆等衆五萬來援，放率所督將陳度、趙伯超等夾擊，大破之。",
      "reading": "魏常山王元昭等援至。梁傳五萬，南史韋放傳同。陳慶之傳稱十五萬及另一戰序。",
      "note": "魏常山王元昭等援至。梁傳五萬，南史韋放傳同。陳慶之傳稱十五萬及另一戰序。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 167,
      "end_codepoint": 214,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-214",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "渦陽城主王緯以城降。",
      "reading": "城主王緯降，殿本作王偉。該位城主在普通八年一役有明確名位。",
      "note": "城主王緯降，殿本作王偉。該位城主在普通八年一役有明確名位。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 214,
      "end_codepoint": 224,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-224",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "放乃登城，簡出降口四千二百人，器仗充牣；又遣降人三十，分報李獎、費穆等。",
      "reading": "查降口，分遣降者告李獎與費穆。",
      "note": "查降口，分遣降者告李獎與費穆。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 224,
      "end_codepoint": 260,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-260",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "魏人棄諸營壘，一時奔潰，衆軍乘之，斬獲略盡。",
      "reading": "魏軍棄陣，梁軍乘隙追擊。",
      "note": "魏軍棄陣，梁軍乘隙追擊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 260,
      "end_codepoint": 282,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-282",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "擒穆弟超，並王緯送於京師。",
      "reading": "費穆弟費超與渦陽城主皆被送京。同役趙伯超由前句明列在韋放部下。",
      "note": "費穆弟費超與渦陽城主皆被送京。同役趙伯超由前句明列在韋放部下。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 282,
      "end_codepoint": 295,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-295",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "還爲太子右衛率，轉通直散騎常侍。",
      "reading": "還為太子右衛率，轉通直散騎常侍。",
      "note": "還為太子右衛率，轉通直散騎常侍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 295,
      "end_codepoint": 311,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-311",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "出爲持節、督梁南秦二州諸軍事、信武將軍、梁南秦二州刺史。",
      "reading": "出任梁、南秦二州軍政。",
      "note": "出任梁、南秦二州軍政。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 311,
      "end_codepoint": 339,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-339",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "中大通二年，徙督北徐州諸軍事、北徐州刺史，增封四百戶，持節、將軍如故。",
      "reading": "中大通二年徙北徐州，增封四百戶。",
      "note": "中大通二年徙北徐州，增封四百戶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 339,
      "end_codepoint": 374,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-374",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "在鎮三年，卒，時年五十九。",
      "reading": "在鎮三年後卒，享年五十九。",
      "note": "在鎮三年後卒，享年五十九。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 374,
      "end_codepoint": 387,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence3-387",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "諡曰宜侯。",
      "reading": "諡宜侯。原齒數不換算生年。",
      "note": "諡宜侯。原齒數不換算生年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 387,
      "end_codepoint": 392,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "放性弘厚篤實，輕財好施，于諸弟尤雍睦。",
      "reading": "性情寬厚，與諸弟和睦。",
      "note": "性情寬厚，與諸弟和睦。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 19,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence4-19",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "每將遠別及行役初還，常同一室臥起，時稱爲「三姜」。",
      "reading": "三姜指諸弟之友愛，同室起居，南史作三薑。",
      "note": "三姜指諸弟之友愛，同室起居，南史作三薑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 19,
      "end_codepoint": 44,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence4-44",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "初，放與吳郡張率皆有側室懷孕，因指爲婚姻。",
      "reading": "韋放與張率以各自側室所懷子女議婚。二側室未載姓。",
      "note": "韋放與張率以各自側室所懷子女議婚。二側室未載姓。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 44,
      "end_codepoint": 65,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence4-65",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "其後各產男女，未及成長而率亡，遺嗣孤弱，放常贍卹之。",
      "reading": "張率死後，韋放贍卹其子女。",
      "note": "張率死後，韋放贍卹其子女。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 65,
      "end_codepoint": 91,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:received_sentence4-91",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "axs_5y7_p7w_AAA",
      "source_quote": "及爲北徐州，時有勢族請姻者，放曰：「吾不失信於故友。」",
      "reading": "鎮北徐州，有權勢之家請婚，韋放守故友約。",
      "note": "鎮北徐州，有權勢之家請婚，韋放守故友約。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 91,
      "end_codepoint": 118,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
